OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer and inmate shared
OL,4,A5,000 messages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison officer and inmate shared more
OL,7,Fthan 5,000 illicit Snapchat messages
OL,8,Fduring a secret fling, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FJade Morris, from Holmer in
OL,12,FHerefordshire, was discovered to be
OL,13,Fhaving a relationship with convicted
OL,14,Fdrug dealer Jerome Nunes, 35, after he
OL,15,Fflung a banned mobile phone out of a
OL,16,Fcell window in October 2022.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
