OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer and inmate shared
OL,4,A5,000 messages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 37-year-old former custody officer,
OL,7,Fwho worked in the maximum-security unit
OL,8,Fat HMP Long Lartin in Worcestershire,
OL,9,Falso exchanged dozens of WhatsApp
OL,10,Fmessages with Nunes, a sentencing
OL,11,Fhearing was told.
OL,13,FShe pleaded guilty at a hearing in
OL,14,FMarch to offences of misconduct in
OL,15,Fpublic office and encouraging Nunes to
OL,16,Fuse a prohibited device. Both are set
OL,17,Fto be sentenced on Friday.
